@startuml
title RF35 — Fim de temporada: playoffs, renovações, free agency e draft · Máquina de estados: Season.phase (fim de temporada e entressafra)
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "REGULAR" as REGULAR
REGULAR : 17 jogos + bye
state "PLAYOFFS" as PLAYOFFS
PLAYOFFS : 7 por conferência
PLAYOFFS : final neutra
state "OFFSEASON" as OFFSEASON
OFFSEASON : resumo e prêmios
OFFSEASON : renovações e franchise tag
state "FREE_AGENCY" as FREE_AGENCY
FREE_AGENCY : agentes livres e trocas
FREE_AGENCY : teto rígido
state "DRAFT" as DRAFT
DRAFT : 7 rodadas (RF51)
state "PRESEASON (n+1)" as PRESEASON
PRESEASON : evolução, cortes para 53
PRESEASON : calendário gerado
[*] --> REGULAR
REGULAR --> PLAYOFFS : última semana
PLAYOFFS --> OFFSEASON : final decidida · SeasonClose
OFFSEASON --> FREE_AGENCY : advance · teto n+1 ok
FREE_AGENCY --> DRAFT : advance
DRAFT --> PRESEASON : draft concluído · sem pendências
PRESEASON --> REGULAR : semana 1
@enduml
